  excerpt: "Today I found out Microsoft PowerToys has added a new feature called QuickAccent that lets you add diacritic marks and other special characters related to a letter you click. For example, you can add e-tilde (é) for Spanish languages by clicking the letter &#8216;e' then quickly holding down a trigger key to pop up the [&hellip;]",
  contentHtml: '\n<p>Today I found out <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/powertoys/install" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Microsoft PowerToys</a> has added a new feature called QuickAccent that lets you add diacritic marks and other special characters related to a letter you click. For example, you can add e-tilde (é) for Spanish languages by clicking the letter &#8216;e&#8217; then quickly holding down a trigger key to pop up the diacritic selection dialog on screen. When you open it, it looks like the screen below. Just click left/right arrows to select your character.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><img data-dominant-color="fafafa" data-has-transparency="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="443" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-1024x443.avif" alt="" class="wp-image-7968 not-transparent" style="--dominant-color: #fafafa; width:1200px;height:auto" srcset="https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-1024x443.avif 1024w, https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-500x216.avif 500w, https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-768x332.avif 768w, https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-1536x665.avif 1536w, https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-png.avif 2043w" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><img data-dominant-color="f0f1f1" data-has-transparency="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="536" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-2-1024x536.avif" alt="" class="wp-image-7973 not-transparent" style="--dominant-color: #f0f1f1; width:1200px;height:auto" srcset="https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-2-1024x536.avif 1024w, https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-2-500x262.avif 500w, https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-2-768x402.avif 768w, https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/image-2-png.avif 1426w" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Choose your character!</em></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img data-dominant-color="4e4944" data-has-transparency="false" style="--dominant-color: #4e4944;" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="640" height="464" sizes="auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" src="https://www.ryanjohnson.website/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/super-smash-bros-melee-smash-bros.gif" alt="" class="wp-image-7969 not-transparent"/></figure>\n',
  wordpressId: 7967,
}
